[[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179004987.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>- Open the sliding side door to the end of its travel.</p><p>1. Use a drill to drill out the notches on the child safety device.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179004989.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179004988.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<p>1. Use a screwdriver to release the retaining tabs.</p><p>2. Withdraw the child safety device and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179004990.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Position a new safety device in its seat and push home until it clicks into place.</p><p>- Check the operation of sliding side door opening/closure.</p>"]]